  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <article-body class=\"block relative\">\n   <p class=\"font-bold text-lg text-grey-400\">By: id Software</p>\n   <time datetime=\"2026-08-06T16:00:00.000Z\" class=\"block mb-4 xl:mb-7 font-body text-grey-500\">8/6/2026</time><picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"772px\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_8ad083c.avif 772w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_6955b73.avif 1544w\"><source sizes=\"1059px\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_41f06af.avif 1059w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_1bf71c9.avif 2118w\"><source sizes=\"1456px\" media=\"(max-width: 1279px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_c6ef1d3.avif 1456w\"><img alt=\"Key art for Dawn of the Machine, featuring an angelic statue forming the Quake &quot;Q&quot; symbol.\" class=\"box-glow mb-9 w-full object-cover aspect-[7/4]\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:left; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_8ad083c.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_6955b73.avif 1544w\" sizes=\"1544px\" data-focal-direction-x=\"left\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n   <section class=\"lg:mb-10 relative prose prose-lg max-w-none\">\n    <p>To celebrate&nbsp;the 30th&nbsp;Anniversary of Quake,&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;collaborated&nbsp;with&nbsp;MachineGames&nbsp;to create a&nbsp;new episode,&nbsp;<strong>Dawn of the Machine</strong>, now available as a free update to Quake.</p>\n    <article-embed><iframe frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2Uf4PcgE8gA\"></iframe></article-embed>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>🆕WHAT'S NEW</h1>\n    <button aria-label=\"Key art for Dawn of the Machine, featuring an angelic statue 