⚙️DAWN OF THE MACHINE</h2>\n    <button aria-label=\"A large gate stands, with each side coming together to form a massive &quot;30&quot;\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"A large gate stands, with each side coming together to form a massive &quot;30&quot;\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_7e4c1fe.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_c1dd309.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_8c53fea.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_aaa82d1.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_1ff49a7.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_33afb01.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_dd23d59.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_7e4c1fe.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <img alt=\"A large gate stands, with each side coming together to form a massive &quot;30&quot;\" sizes=\"75vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_28d9289.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_251f20e.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_dce9774.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_e7db69a.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_518a622.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_aaa82d1.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_1ff49a7.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_c8878ff.avif 2304w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_28d9289.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Celebrating 30 years of Quake, the award-winning team at&nbsp;MachineGames—in collaboration with id Software—returns with <strong>Dawn of the Machine</strong>, a brutal new episode building on their critically acclaimed work on <em>Dimension of the Machine</em> and <em>Dimensions of the Past</em>. Delivering ferocious combat, labyrinthine level design, and nightmarish realms that twist reality beyond recognition, it&nbsp;pushes the legacy of the genre-defining first-person shooter even further—honoring one of gaming’s most enduring icons.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n    <h3>🏃‍♂️‍➡️END THE NIGHTMARE. 😶‍🌫️ESCAPE THE ILLUSION.</h3>\n    <button aria-label=\"An ominous chamber features skull-adorned fixtures and a character hanging upside down from the ceiling.\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"An ominous chamber features skull-adorned fixtures and a character hanging upside down from the ceiling.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_2538c66.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_3618a64.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_496b757.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_25dad7c.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_08a614e.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_043f2bf.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_9fb4fc1.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_2538c66.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"75vw\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_4036c05.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_1242cb9.avif 960w\"><img alt=\"An ominous chamber features skull-adorned fixtures and a character hanging upside down from the ceiling.\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_4036c05.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_3ce1426.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_4b3f5ff.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_0278fc8.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_538d6f7.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_25dad7c.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_08a614e.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_52bb871.avif 2304w\" sizes=\"75vw\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Ranger is trapped in a dimension of endless illusion—reliving the same violent cycles for what feels like lifetimes, dying thousands of times in a futile attempt to escape. Wearied but unbroken, he has heard&nbsp;rumor&nbsp;of The Nightmare Machine.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n    <p>Beyond the hordes of monsters—twisted by an eternity in the&nbsp;Elder&nbsp;realms—lies the Machine. It is believed its destruction will shatter the illusion, finally breaking the loop.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n    <h3>🆓FREE FOR QUAKE OWNERS</h3>\n    <button aria-label=\"An angelic statue sits beneath a spotlight inside an antechamber.\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"An angelic statue sits beneath a spotlight inside an antechamber.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_73e47b7.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_8249859.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_1d938a2.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_926c763.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d2dd09d.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_bb04345.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_ab6324f.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_73e47b7.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"75vw\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_34526b4.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_9b2bcfe.avif 960w\"><img alt=\"An angelic statue sits beneath a spotlight inside an antechamber.\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_34526b4.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_4ea56c0.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_a4639ee.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_f66d5d5.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_1715a4d.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_926c763.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d2dd09d.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_0c5497d.avif 2304w\" sizes=\"75vw\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Dawn of the Machine is available as a free update for Quake owners on XBOX Series X/S, XBOX One, Microsoft PC Store, Game Pass, PC Game Pass, Steam, PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch 2 (via backwards compatibility), and Nintendo Switch versions of Quake. This expansive new episode features 19 all-new maps across a cohesive campaign, alongside a brand-new soundtrack, hidden secrets, a dedicated episode hub, and an all-new deathmatch map.&nbsp;</p>\n    <h3>👹NEW ENEMY AND ⚔️WEAPON VARIANTS</h3>\n    <button aria-label=\"Gameplay of Dawn of the Machine featuring combat against Rocket Ogres.\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"Gameplay of Dawn of the Machine featuring combat against Rocket Ogres.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_40233fe.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_bfa9ab7.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_e48500d.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_cce5e84.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_799a244.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_21fa54a.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_b5ef84b.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_40233fe.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"75vw\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_299ca4f.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_77d618c.avif 960w\"><img alt=\"Gameplay of Dawn of the Machine featuring combat against Rocket Ogres.\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_299ca4f.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_f3d79af.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_7787df6.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_8d2f1c4.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_7624b56.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_cce5e84.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_799a244.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_7c942cd.avif 2304w\" sizes=\"75vw\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Face deadly new twists on familiar foes, including the Rocket Ogre, Demo Dog, Blood&nbsp;Shambler, and more. Each variant introduces lethal new behaviours—from overwhelming firepower to explosive death traps—forcing you to rethink every encounter. Expand your arsenal with brutal variants inspired by classic&nbsp;Quake&nbsp;expansions, including the Super Axe—unleashing lightning on successive strikes—and the Laser Cannon, firing ricocheting projectiles that tear through enemies from every angle.&nbsp;</p>\n    <h3>♻️REPLAYABLE EPISODE LOOP</h3>\n    <button aria-label=\"A high-rising castle stands as moss and ivy rest on its walls.\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"A high-rising castle stands as moss and ivy rest on its walls.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d0b748c.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_27d2db2.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_aaaf455.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_50da42a.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_fb929d8.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_bb0dc90.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_92ed734.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d0b748c.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"75vw\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_5867b2b.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d4092c0.avif 960w\"><img alt=\"A high-rising castle stands as moss and ivy rest on its walls.\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_5867b2b.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_abf9037.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_dd820e8.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_6c83f51.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_23e2d62.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_50da42a.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_fb929d8.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_222e9fa.avif 2304w\" sizes=\"75vw\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Time folds back on itself in a unique looping structure, where each return reshapes the experience. Runes unlock previously sealed paths, drawing you back through familiar spaces now altered with new routes, encounters, and secrets waiting to be discovered. Persistent health and ammo upgrades found throughout the realm ensure each loop makes you stronger, introducing a new layer of progression to&nbsp;Quake.&nbsp;</p>\n    <h3>🎭EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</h3>\n    <button aria-label=\"The player aims a Laser Cannon down a futuristic corridor.\" class=\"group not-prose\" data-element=\"article-image\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-tag=\"video-modal-trigger\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\" x-on:click.prevent=\"open = !open\" x-bind:aria-expanded=\"open\"><img alt=\"The player aims a Laser Cannon down a futuristic corridor.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_e76d61b.avif 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_d5e68e7.avif 1024w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_399b5d5.avif 1280w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_dfc0ef1.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_8034877.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_8487666.avif 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_9307f6b.avif 2560w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_e76d61b.avif\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\">\n     <template x-if=\"open\">\n      <template x-teleport=\"main\">\n       <dialog style=\"background:none\" aria-modal=\"true\" x-data=\"{\n              closing: false,\n              close() {\n                if (!this.closing) {\n                  this.closing = true;\n                  setTimeout(() =&gt; { $el.close(); open = false; }, 200);\n                }\n              },\n            }\" x-effect=\"$el.showModal()\" x-on:keydown.escape.prevent=\"close()\" x-on:cancel.prevent=\"close()\" class=\"fixed w-full h-full bg-black p-0 flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <dialog-overlay x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-show=\"open &amp;&amp; mounted &amp;&amp; !closing\" x-transition:enter=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave=\"ease-in-out duration-200\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-transition:leave-end=\"opacity-0\" class=\"fixed w-full inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm\"></dialog-overlay>\n        <dialog-panel x-data=\"{ mounted: false }\" x-effect=\"mounted = true\" x-lock-scroll=\"open\" x-on:click.outside.capture=\"close()\" x-bind:style=\"mounted &amp;&amp; !closing ? { opacity: 1 } : {}\" class=\"relative opacity-0 transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-200\">\n         <button type=\"button\" x-on:click.prevent=\"close()\" tab-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Close\" class=\"fixed top-6 right-6 z-50\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Close</span>\n          <svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"presentation\">\n           <path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z\"></path>\n          </svg></button>\n         <div class=\"gallery-modal-container\">\n          <picture style=\"display:contents\"><source sizes=\"75vw\" media=\"(max-width: 639px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_c2cc197.avif 480w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_e80a716.avif 960w\"><img alt=\"The player aims a Laser Cannon down a futuristic corridor.\" style=\"--focal-direction-x:center; --focal-direction-y:center\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_c2cc197.avif\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_68c9a82.avif 768w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_fb5240b.avif 960w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214433_e98df62.avif 1152w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_fac5ddc.avif 1440w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_dfc0ef1.avif 1536w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214431_8034877.avif 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260806214432_69cba35.avif 2304w\" sizes=\"75vw\" data-focal-direction-x=\"center\" data-focal-direction-y=\"center\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </dialog-panel>\n       </dialog>\n      </template>\n     </template></button>\n    <p>Reality is never stable. Shift between dimensions to solve puzzles and navigate the world, or find hidden secrets scattered throughout the realms. Face enemies that rise again or transform after death, and experience encounters where the rules change without warning—forcing you to adapt or be overrun.&nbsp;</p>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>🔒id VAULT</h1>\n    <p>Browse a behind-the-scenes gallery of development assets and unused content.&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;playable maps, including some levels from the earliest stages of Quake’s development</p>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>🏆NEW&nbsp;ACHIEVEMENTS</h1>\n    <p>Three new achievements are available to earn while playing Dawn of the Machine</p>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>🤫CHEATS MENU&nbsp;</h1>\n    <p>Access the new Cheats menu at any time in single player games to help you through a tough&nbsp;area or&nbsp;just explore levels without fear of enemies</p>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>🛠️FIXES&nbsp;</h1>\n    <h2>ALL PLATFORMS&nbsp;</h2>\n    <ul>\n     <li>Improved interpolation. This&nbsp;reduces input&nbsp;latency and&nbsp;lessens&nbsp;occurrences where&nbsp;the camera would visually fall behind your weapon&nbsp;and weapon effects</li>\n     <li>Fixed an issue where the camera would interpolate between&nbsp;position changes that were too large to&nbsp;possibly be&nbsp;stairs&nbsp;(silent teleporters)</li>\n     <li>Re-added&nbsp;weapon bobbing&nbsp;effects&nbsp;when view bobbing is disabled</li>\n     <li>Weapon bob can now be turned on or off separately from view bob</li>\n     <li>Removed shadow&nbsp;casting&nbsp;from Hell Knight projectiles to improve visuals&nbsp;in its ranged attack</li>\n     <li>Shadow casting lights from enemies are now capped to improve performance in scenes with lots of Enforcers firing weapons</li>\n     <li>Reduced memory usage&nbsp;from&nbsp;menus</li>\n     <li>Improved font rendering when using the larger accessible typeface</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h2>PLAYSTATION 5&nbsp;</h2>\n    <ul>\n     <li>Fixed weapons&nbsp;in&nbsp;Scourge&nbsp;of&nbsp;Armagon&nbsp;not having controller vibration or controller speaker sounds</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>👷MODDING CHANGES&nbsp;</h1>\n    <ul>\n     <li>Localization strings are now stored in the Quake PAK, instead of&nbsp;outside&nbsp;the game data in the KPF file.&nbsp;Third party engines that previously read strings from the KPF file will&nbsp;need to be&nbsp;updated to read from the PAK&nbsp;file and&nbsp;should no longer need to load the KPF file&nbsp;at all</li>\n     <li>Mods can optionally add new mod-specific localization by overriding localization/loc_(language)_mod.txt&nbsp;in their PAK files</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr>\n    <h1>❓FAQs&nbsp;</h1>\n    <article-quote class=\"not-prose\">\n     <quote-mark>“</quote-mark>\n     <quote-content>\n      <p>I already own Quake. How do I access the new episode, Dawn of the Machine?&nbsp;</p>\n      <cite>If you already own Quake,&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;receive the new update automatically as a free download. Depending on your settings, the update may already be installed. Once updated, you can start a new game, select a level, or play cooperative multiplayer in Dawn of the Machine</cite>\n     </quote-content>\n    </article-quote>\n    <article-quote class=\"not-prose\">\n     <quote-mark>“</quote-mark>\n     <quote-content>\n      <p>Which&nbsp;platforms&nbsp;is&nbsp;Dawn of the Machine&nbsp;available&nbsp;in&nbsp;Quake?&nbsp;</p>\n      <cite>Dawn of the Machine is currently available on XBOX&nbsp;Series X/S, XBOX&nbsp;One, Microsoft PC Store, Game Pass, PC Game Pass, Steam,&nbsp;Nintendo Switch 2 (via backwards compatibility), Nintendo Switch, PlayStation&nbsp;5&nbsp;and PlayStation&nbsp;4&nbsp;versions of Quake</cite>\n     </quote-content>\n    </article-quote>\n    <article-quote class=\"not-prose\">\n     <quote-mark>“</quote-mark>\n     <quote-content>\n      <p>Is Dawn of the Machine available on the Epic Games&nbsp;Store&nbsp;or GOG&nbsp;versions&nbsp;of Quake?</p>\n      <cite>Dawn of the Machine is&nbsp;currently not available on the&nbsp;Epic Games Store&nbsp;or GOG versions of&nbsp;Quake</cite>\n     </quote-content>\n    </article-quote>\n    <article-quote class=\"not-prose\">\n     <quote-mark>“</quote-mark>\n     <quote-content>\n      <p>I play Quake on GOG or the Epic Games Store. Why do I see a “Disconnected from servers” message when invited to play Dawn of the Machine maps with players on Steam or console?&nbsp;</p>\n      <cite>If&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;playing Quake on GOG or the Epic Games Store, you may see a “Disconnected from servers” message when accepting an invitation from a Steam or console player for Dawn of the Machine episode or maps. This message appears because the Dawn of the Machine update is currently available on supported platforms, while the GOG and Epic Games Store versions do not yet include this content. Your account has not been disconnected or penalized</cite>\n     </quote-content>\n    </article-quote>\n    <article-quote class=\"not-prose\">\n     <quote-mark>“</quote-mark>\n     <quote-content>\n      <p>Known Issue: Quake players hosting a Dawn of the Machine online multiplayer match on Switch will disconnect from the lobby on level transitions, forcing other players to drop too.</p>\n      <cite>Workaround: To avoid this issue, Switch players should avoid hosting online multiplayer games featuring Dawn of the Machine maps and join cross-play games featuring these maps instead.</cite>\n     </quote-content>\n    </article-quote>\n    <p></p>\n    <p>*If you're still experiencing issues, please holler at our amazing <a href=\"https://help.bethesda.net/#en/home/product/1197\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Customer Service team</a></p>\n   </section>\n   <social-sharing class=\"flex gap-4 items-center justify-center relative w-full py-5 mb-8\">\n    <svg class=\"absolute w-full h-full\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 872 91\">\n     <path style=\"opacity:0.07;fill:white\" d=\"M0 7.32319L170.809 0L319.562 11.3177L692.471 0L872 7.32319V91L611.426 82.3453L251.854 91L0 82.3453V7.32319Z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <a class=\"flex gap-4 items-center justify-center relative py-2 px-6 text-white text-2xl no-underline uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--heading-font-family)\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fslayersclub.bethesda.net%2Fen-US%2Fnews%2Fquake-30th-anniversary-update}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Share\"> \n     <svg class=\"absolute w-full h-full\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 136 50\">\n      <path style=\"opacity:0.18;stroke:white;stroke-width:1.5\" d=\"M46.6072 3.55722L46.5953 3.55774L46.5834 3.55788L0.818249 4.09919L4.11659 47.8636L57.2519 46.098L57.2764 46.0972L57.3009 46.098L134.505 48.578L134.443 5.22683L92.8499 1.54228L46.6072 3.55722Z\"></path>\n     </svg> \n     <svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path style=\"fill:currentcolor\" d=\"M17,2V2H17V6H15C14.31,6 14,6.81 14,7.5V10H14L17,10V14H14V22H10V14H7V10H10V6A4,4 0 0,1 14,2H17Z\"></path>\n     </svg>Share \n    </a><a class=\"flex gap-4 items-center justify-center relative py-2 px-6 text-white text-2xl no-underline uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--heading-font-family)\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Quake%20%E2%80%93%2030th%20Anniversary%20Update&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fslayersclub.bethesda.net%2Fen-US%2Fnews%2Fqu